Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:31.80,0:01:33.68,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}又要欠你人情了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:34.19,0:01:35.76,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}反正你也没打算还吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:36.30,0:01:39.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这是他们以情报公开法为由索要到的资料
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:39.92,0:01:41.92,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}但已预先混入了假情报
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:42.70,0:01:45.15,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}政府暗中准备好了法律应对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:45.30,0:01:47.12,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}但预计这几天会中止
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:47.75,0:01:50.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}怎么样？关于那个计划
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:50.00,0:01:51.68,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这边要不要也设法处理
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:52.00,0:01:52.75,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不用
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:52.75,0:01:55.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}照你的资料来看，应该不会有问题
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:55.75,0:01:57.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那么，就照剧本行事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:10.50,0:02:11.85,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}早上好…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:15.95,0:02:16.56,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}早上好…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:26.15,0:02:28.22,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}早上果然还是这个最棒了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:28.96,0:02:30.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不是咖啡吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:30.60,0:02:34.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}日本人啊，自古以来早餐就是白饭和味噌汤
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:34.60,0:02:37.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}还有就是清酒了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:37.50,0:02:38.97,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}美里小姐才是这样的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:39.54,0:02:40.07,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:41.16,0:02:44.48,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}倒是今天该轮到谁做早餐啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:45.45,0:02:48.09,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为什么美里小姐到现在这种年纪还是单身
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:48.60,0:02:50.04,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我好像有点明白了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:50.35,0:02:52.15,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不好意思呢，我很粗俗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:52.90,0:02:54.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}还加上邋遢吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:54.70,0:02:55.65,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}烦死了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:57.10,0:02:58.01,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我吃饱了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:00.60,0:03:02.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}今天真的会来学校吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:02.70,0:03:05.63,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}当然啦，要谈你今后的去向嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:06.20,0:03:07.88,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可是，工作不是很忙吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:08.00,0:03:08.83,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没关系、没关系
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:09.05,0:03:10.42,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这也是工作嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:11.25,0:03:12.46,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}工作吗…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:18.65,0:03:20.35,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}谢谢你们特地过来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:21.15,0:03:22.35,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}稍等一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:22.55,0:03:23.45,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}美里小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:23.50,0:03:25.45,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不要这副样子走出去啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:25.60,0:03:26.55,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}很丢人的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:27.25,0:03:28.25,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:31.50,0:03:33.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}早上好，碇同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:33.62,0:03:34.65,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那么，美里小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:34.65,0:03:35.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我们走了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:35.92,0:03:37.13,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}走好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:39.47,0:03:40.67,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}快走了啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:45.25,0:03:46.25,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}讽刺吗…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:47.05,0:03:49.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不过，表情因此开始丰富了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:49.90,0:03:50.75,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}算是好兆头吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:56.35,0:03:56.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:56.95,0:03:58.25,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}刚才出门了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:58.82,0:04:00.28,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}后面的保卫就拜托了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:12.00,0:04:13.86,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}哇！驾到了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:20.55,0:04:22.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真帅！那是谁啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:22.43,0:04:23.45,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}碇的监护人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:23.65,0:04:24.25,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:24.25,0:04:26.45,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}碇被那种大美人照顾吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:26.55,0:04:27.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}一群傻瓜
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:29.98,0:04:32.15,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真的，美里小姐太棒了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:32.89,0:04:34.35,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,150)}{}{\alpha20}是吗…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:34.35,0:04:37.11,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}而且还是 NERV 的作战部长，更厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:37.73,0:04:38.60,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,150)}{}{\alpha20}是吗…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:40.60,0:04:42.10,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}{}为了来学校谈去向问题
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:42.10,0:04:44.20,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}{}我妈妈还特意做打扮呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:44.90,0:04:46.00,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}{}很傻吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:41.00,0:04:43.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}太好了剑介，真嗣还是小孩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:43.82,0:04:45.82,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}总之，不会是情敌就是了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:46.80,0:04:49.64,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}东二他们根本不知道那女人有多邋遢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:51.30,0:04:53.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}如果有个像她那样的女朋友…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:54.15,0:04:55.69,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你就要苦了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:56.29,0:04:57.81,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你有所不知了，先生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:58.15,0:05:01.02,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}好，地球的和平就交给你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:01.25,0:05:03.67,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}所以美里小姐就交给我们了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:06.35,0:05:08.50,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,150)}初号机通过冷却值
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:08.58,0:05:11.30,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,150)}工作请移至第 2 阶段
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:09.65,0:05:13.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为了地球的和平吗，这个 EVA
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:14.60,0:05:18.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}EVA 是什么呢？有血腥味的插入栓
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:18.56,0:05:21.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可为什么心情却那么平静
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:22.50,0:05:25.47,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}到头来我还是什么都不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:26.50,0:05:28.84,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}零号机的胸部生体部件怎么样了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:29.20,0:05:30.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}严重受损…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:30.80,0:05:32.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}正准备重新制作
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:32.10,0:05:34.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}但追加预算额只是勉强够用
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:34.40,0:05:36.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这样等从德国把二号机运来后
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:36.50,0:05:38.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不知道是不是能稍微轻松一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:38.50,0:05:40.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}说不定正好相反
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:40.20,0:05:43.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}对地上使徒的处理也不便宜吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:43.10,0:05:43.85,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:43.90,0:05:45.95,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}一提到钱就小气得不得了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:46.21,0:05:48.62,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这里可是关系到人类的命运啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:48.62,0:05:49.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}也是没办法的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:49.70,0:05:51.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}人不能只靠 EVA 而活
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:52.15,0:05:55.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}要让存活下来的人继续生存是很花钱的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:55.40,0:05:56.29,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}预算吗…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:56.90,0:05:58.65,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那么，司令又去开会了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:58.65,0:06:00.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是啊，现在已经在机上了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:01.15,0:06:02.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}司令不在的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:02.30,0:06:03.95,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这里变得安静也不错呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:11.75,0:06:12.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}打扰了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:12.96,0:06:15.49,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}坐这不介意吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:17.77,0:06:21.38,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}回收样本的修正预算轻松地就通过了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:21.85,0:06:25.45,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}委员会也会最优先考虑自己的生存
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:25.65,0:06:27.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为了这个不会吝惜金钱的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:27.65,0:06:31.35,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}因为他们以前的论调都是“使徒已经不会再出现了”嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:31.95,0:06:33.28,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}还有一个好消息
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:34.15,0:06:35.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}除了美国以外
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:35.30,0:06:38.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}其余的理事国都核准 EVA 六号机的预算了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:39.40,0:06:41.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}总之，美国也只是时间问题吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:42.80,0:06:46.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}反正那个国家也在对失业者过敏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:46.80,0:06:47.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你的国家呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:48.35,0:06:50.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}参于八号机及其后的建造
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:50.50,0:06:53.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}因为第 2 次整备计划还在进行中的缘故
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:53.85,0:06:57.15,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}只是还有找不到驾驶员的问题
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:57.98,0:07:00.15,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}使徒又出现了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:00.95,0:07:03.59,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我们唯一的选择只有打倒它们而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:04.05,0:07:07.65,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我也不想再体验“第二次冲击”了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:08.58,0:07:09.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这么说…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:09.67,0:07:12.97,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}把南极大陆蒸发的“第二次冲击”是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:13.48,0:07:14.35,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没错
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:14.35,0:07:18.65,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}在历史课本上是写着由于巨大陨石坠落而引起的灾难
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:18.65,0:07:21.12,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}但事实往往都会被人所隐瞒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:21.97,0:07:23.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}15 年前
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:23.27,0:07:28.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}人类在南极发现了最初的称作“使徒”的人型物体
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:28.35,0:07:29.65,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}但就在调查中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:29.65,0:07:31.89,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}发生了原因不明的大爆炸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:32.85,0:07:34.68,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这就是第二次冲击的真相
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:35.68,0:07:37.55,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那么，我们现在所做的…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:38.15,0:07:39.82,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}将可以预料到的“第三次冲击”（Third Impact）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:39.83,0:07:41.22,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}遏止在萌芽状态
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:41.22,0:07:44.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}NERV 和 EVANGELION 就是为此而存在的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:45.26,0:07:46.44,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}话说回来那个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:46.44,0:07:48.41,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}照预定，明天要开了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:50.02,0:07:50.62,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:04.07,0:08:04.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}早上好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:05.55,0:08:07.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}早…早上好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:07.48,0:08:09.34,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}因为工作，要去旧东京一趟
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:10.12,0:08:12.31,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}大概会很晚回来，自己叫外卖吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:13.10,0:08:13.62,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我走了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:16.35,0:08:16.95,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}好…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:31.30,0:08:35.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}很难想象这里就是过去被称作花之都的大都市呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:35.62,0:08:36.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}到了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:38.20,0:08:40.95,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}也不必非跑到这种地方来进行啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:41.85,0:08:44.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}说回来，这个计划战自有插手吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:44.62,0:08:45.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}战略自卫队
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:46.16,0:08:48.37,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不，没有被允许介入
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:48.49,0:08:50.19,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}难怪这么随心所欲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:58.85,0:09:01.21,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}今天各位在百忙之中前来参加
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:01.21,0:09:05.35,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我们日本重化学工业共同体的制品发布会
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:06.00,0:09:07.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我表示衷心的感谢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:09.10,0:09:13.35,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}过一会儿，要请各位到管制室参观公开的试运行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:14.16,0:09:16.75,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}如果有任何问题现在就请提出吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:17.05,0:09:17.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:17.70,0:09:20.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这不是大名鼎鼎的赤木律子博士吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:20.65,0:09:22.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}您能光临真是太荣幸了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:23.15,0:09:25.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}提个问题可以吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:25.75,0:09:26.95,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}请讲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:27.41,0:09:29.05,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}照您刚才的说明
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:29.05,0:09:31.01,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}内燃引擎是内置的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:31.10,0:09:33.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是的，这是本机型的主要特性
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:33.90,0:09:37.66,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可以保证连续 150 天的作战行动
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:38.10,0:09:41.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}但是以参加格斗战为前提的陆战武器
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:41.20,0:09:42.75,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}将反应堆置于内部
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:42.85,0:09:46.15,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}光就安全性来看不是风险太高了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:46.35,0:09:50.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}比起 5 分钟都动不了的决战兵器我觉得会有用得多了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:50.27,0:09:53.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}远程操纵在处理紧急情况方面存在隐患
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:53.54,0:09:56.85,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}比起让驾驶员增加负担引起精神污染
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:56.85,0:09:58.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我觉得这样还比较人道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:59.10,0:10:01.15,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不要再争啦，像小孩子一样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:01.30,0:10:02.95,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}还有人为控制的问题
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:03.25,0:10:05.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}比起无法控制、任其暴走的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:05.80,0:10:08.91,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}危险至极的武器，它安全多了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:09.46,0:10:12.05,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}像什么无法控制的武器简直是荒唐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:12.36,0:10:16.75,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}就和歇斯底里的女人一样，实在是应付不来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:19.55,0:10:22.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}正因为这样才需要驾驶员和技术
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:22.10,0:10:26.16,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}难道以科学和人心就能压制住那个怪物吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:26.62,0:10:27.53,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真那么想
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:27.97,0:10:29.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是的，那是当然的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:29.60,0:10:32.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}就是因为依赖所谓的“人心”之类暧昧的东西
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:32.60,0:10:34.75,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}NERV 才会容许像先前的那种失控事件
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:35.35,0:10:38.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}结果就是联合国被迫通过庞大的追加预算
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:38.82,0:10:41.65,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}某国还差点出现两万人饿死的情况
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:42.40,0:10:44.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}再加上，像那么重要的事件
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:44.90,0:10:46.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}竟然到现在还原因不明
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:47.57,0:10:51.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}希望身为负责人应该尽到职责才是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:51.45,0:10:55.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真好啊，NERV 受到了超法规的保护
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:55.10,0:10:57.45,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}所以你们也不必承担什么责任
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:58.20,0:10:59.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不管您怎么说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:59.70,0:11:02.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不靠 NERV 的主力武器是无法打倒敌人的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:03.20,0:11:04.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}A.T.Field 是吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:05.10,0:11:07.35,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这个现在也只是时间问题而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:07.80,0:11:10.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不会永远都是 NERV 的时代的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:16.50,0:11:17.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可恶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:17.10,0:11:18.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:18.10,0:11:19.43,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那帮俗人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:20.40,0:11:23.55,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}反正一定是对我们特权眼红的人想趁机出口气吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:24.15,0:11:26.55,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真 叫 人 一 肚 子 火
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:28.55,0:11:30.15,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不要闹了，像小孩子一样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:31.05,0:11:33.85,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}想靠炫耀自己来获得称赞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:34.10,0:11:36.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不是什么了不起的男人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:36.30,0:11:39.15,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}但为什么那些家伙连 A.T.Field 都知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:39.40,0:11:41.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}最高机密泄漏了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:41.30,0:11:43.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}情报部在做什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:56.45,0:11:59.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}现在开始 J.A. 的启动实验
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:00.30,0:12:01.85,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不会有任何危险
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:02.95,0:12:05.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}就请从窗口放心地观看吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:07.67,0:12:08.95,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}启动准备完毕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:08.97,0:12:10.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}开始试验
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:12.00,0:12:14.50,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,150)}冷凝系统没有问题
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:10.20,0:12:11.62,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}开放所有动力
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:11.62,0:12:12.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}压力正常
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:13.30,0:12:15.05,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}冷却系统循环没有异常
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:15.05,0:12:16.85,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}控制棒完全抽出
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:15.50,0:12:17.50,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,150)}加压器系统没有问题
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:16.85,0:12:18.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}动力堆突破临界点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:18.80,0:12:20.35,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}动力输出没有问题
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:20.35,0:12:21.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}开始步行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:21.75,0:12:23.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}步行，慢速前进
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:23.30,0:12:24.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}右脚向前
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:24.35,0:12:25.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}明白
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:25.00,0:12:26.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}步行，慢速前进
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:26.90,0:12:27.85,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}右脚向前
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:34.75,0:12:36.42,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}所有减震器正常
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:34.22,0:12:35.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}平衡正常
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:35.35,0:12:36.42,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}动力没有异常
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:36.42,0:12:39.05,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}明白，接着左脚向前
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:39.05,0:12:40.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:43.15,0:12:46.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}走得很好嘛，看来还是有炫耀的资本呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:49.95,0:12:50.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}怎么了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:50.70,0:12:53.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}奇怪，反应堆的内压正在上升
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:54.15,0:12:56.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}一回路冷却水的温度也在上升
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:56.10,0:12:57.20,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}内压上升
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:57.20,0:12:58.30,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}10.5%
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:58.30,0:12:59.60,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}11.8%
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:59.60,0:13:00.90,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}14.6%
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:00.90,0:13:01.95,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}无法停止
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:56.75,0:12:59.36,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}开启阀门，注入减速剂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:59.65,0:13:02.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不行，泵的输出功率没有上升
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:05.40,0:13:06.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:06.10,0:13:07.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}切断动力，紧急停止
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:07.45,0:13:09.15,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}{}一回路冷却水温度仍在上升
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:09.15,0:13:10.40,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,150)}{}即将抵达警戒区域
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:09.25,0:13:11.40,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,150)}{}备用给水系统没有启动
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:10.40,0:13:12.60,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,150)}{}再循环泵的输出功率降至 20%
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:07.60,0:13:09.25,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}停止信号！确认已发出
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:10.05,0:13:11.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}信号没被接受
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:11.12,0:13:12.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}无线线路也不通
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:12.85,0:13:13.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}无法控制
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:14.45,0:13:15.88,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}怎么会这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:30.20,0:13:33.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}和制作它的人一样不懂礼貌的机器人呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:39.00,0:13:40.80,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}{}一回路冷却水温度仍在上升
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:40.80,0:13:42.40,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,150)}{}即将抵达危险区域
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:41.50,0:13:44.00,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,150)}{}冷凝系统发生问题
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:43.30,0:13:44.80,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}{}备用制动系统无法启动
