Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:06.25,0:16:09.95,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}目標はＪ.Ａ.５分以内に炉心融解の危険が あります
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:10.30,0:16:14.45,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ですから 目標をこれ以上⸺人口密集地に 近づけるわけにはいきません
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:14.85,0:16:15.50,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}日向君
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:15.50,0:16:16.00,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}はい
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:16.20,0:16:17.50,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}エヴァを切り離したあとは
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:17.65,0:16:18.90,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}速やかに離脱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:18.90,0:16:20.24,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}安全高度まで上昇して
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:20.40,0:16:20.84,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}了解
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:21.15,0:16:21.85,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}シンジ君
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:21.85,0:16:22.50,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}はい
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:22.50,0:16:23.50,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}目標と並走し
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:23.65,0:16:25.30,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}私を背後部に取り付けて
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:25.55,0:16:28.41,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}以後は目標の移動を 可能な限り せき止めてね
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:29.30,0:16:31.62,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}乗るんですか？ ミサトさんが？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:31.63,0:16:32.10,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}そうよ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:32.40,0:16:33.60,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}そんなムチャな！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:33.80,0:16:34.80,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ムチャは承知よ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:34.80,0:16:36.59,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}他にベターな方法がないの
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:36.80,0:16:37.45,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}でも…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:37.45,0:16:38.37,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}危なすぎますよ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:38.64,0:16:39.49,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}大丈夫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:39.54,0:16:42.40,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}エヴァなら 万が一の直撃にも耐えられるわ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:42.74,0:16:43.62,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}じゃなくって
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:43.88,0:16:44.84,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ミサトさんが！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:45.30,0:16:47.84,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}まっ やれること やっとかないとね
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:48.10,0:16:49.87,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}後味 悪いでしょ？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:53.25,0:16:54.80,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}目標を肉眼で確認
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:59.05,0:17:00.30,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}さっ 行くわよ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:04.80,0:17:06.20,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}エヴァ 投下位置
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:06.65,0:17:07.65,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ドッキングアウト！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:07.95,0:17:08.50,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}了解！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:27.65,0:17:28.20,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}追いついた！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:28.40,0:17:29.50,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}あと４分もないわ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:29.60,0:17:30.75,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}このまま乗りつけて！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:41.65,0:17:43.20,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}構わないわ やって！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:50.30,0:17:51.10,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}あ… キャア！ ミサトさん！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:55.80,0:17:56.55,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}気を付けて！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:01.60,0:18:04.50,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}すごい熱こりゃ マズいわね
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:04.85,0:18:06.83,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}止まれ！ このー！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:12.60,0:18:14.15,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ミサトさん 急いで！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:16.60,0:18:17.08,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ここね
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:32.55,0:18:34.73,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}エラー？ 何よ これ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:40.60,0:18:43.30,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}間違いない プログラムが変えてあるんだわ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:50.45,0:18:52.70,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}動力炉 臨界点まで あと0.2！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:53.10,0:18:54.80,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}制御棒 作動しません！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:55.30,0:18:57.05,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}こーなったら イチかバチかね
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:14.90,0:19:16.56,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ミサトさん！ 逃げて！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:17.10,0:19:19.91,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}動けぇ… このー！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:24.55,0:19:25.29,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ミサトさん！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:30.83,0:19:32.55,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}臨界まで あと0.1！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:32.70,0:19:34.10,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ダメです 爆発します！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:35.25,0:19:36.00,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}くっ… ダメか
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:36.00,0:19:36.91,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ミサトさん！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:00.25,0:20:01.45,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}やった！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:01.50,0:20:02.35,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}内圧ダウン！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:02.35,0:20:03.70,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}全て正常位置！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:07.15,0:20:08.83,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}やった！ やった！ やった！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:09.64,0:20:10.55,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}あのバカ…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:11.20,0:20:12.05,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ミサトさん
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:12.05,0:20:12.58,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}大丈夫ですか！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:13.10,0:20:13.68,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ミサトさん！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:14.30,0:20:16.92,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ええ もうサイテーだけどね
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:18.15,0:20:18.70,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}よかった！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:19.05,0:20:20.15,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}無事なんですね！
